      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استزمر</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>He was,</i> or <i>became, abject,</i> or <i>ignominious,</i> or <i>weak,</i> and <i>small in body, and lean;</i>
being abased or brought low. (A, TA.) [See
also the part n., below.]

